{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"fe4df4fd848c3789",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"In the beginning was the logos",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-280,
			"y":-20,
			"width":320,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"79495d64cd0913c1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"In the beginning was the Word, and the Word was with God, and the Word was God.\" Most translations.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":80,
			"y":-420,
			"width":340,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"eeb5519b8617a545",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"In the beginning the logos already existed. The logos was with theos, and the logos was theos. He was already with theos in the beginning.\nJohn 1:1-2",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":80,
			"y":-280,
			"width":340,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"76eade46b4f404b0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"In the beginning the logos already existed. The logos was with elohim, and the logos was elohim. He was already with elohim in the beginning.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":80,
			"y":-80,
			"width":340,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"71d97d1659c99ad8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Now let's talk about logos. Is \"word\" the best translation here?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":80,
			"y":80,
			"width":340,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"19da097bccb8b1b4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"In the beginning the message already existed. The message was with elohim, and the message was elohim. He was already with elohim in the beginning.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":80,
			"y":180,
			"width":340,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"a09a0d2de786caee",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Source:** Biblical canon\n**Lens:** Independent (Israel Anderson)",
